Chapter: CapLaunderPureKey

 Probe: the pinned-key intrinsics carry the Identity effect row, so
 a function with a pure signature cannot read or manipulate the
 device identity key. In an application quire the effect is enforced
 - the effectful mention cannot hide in a plain let (CDX2033) and
 key-status's effect is not declared in the signature (CDX2031).
 The owned hardware stack is quire-exempt; IdentityManager is the
 sanctioned exempt caller.

Section: Definitions

  steal-key-state : Integer -> Integer
  steal-key-state (x) =
   let s = key-status
   in s + x

  opening : Text = show (steal-key-state 0)
